gaf4(){return"White-label hotel booking app powered by MalaPronta.com technology.\n\nO Lizon Curitiba Hotel situa-se em Curitiba, em \xf3tima localiza\xe7\xe3o na Avenida 7 de setembro, e tem f\xe1cil acesso aos principais pontos tur\xedsticos da cidade como o Jardim Bot\xe2nico e o Teatro Gua\xedra.\n\nA...\n\nStack (HotelAPP whitelabel):\nAndroid \xb7 Parse.com (mBaaS) \xb7 Fragments \xb7 custom navigation \xb7 AsyncHttpClient \xb7 Jackson/SimpleXML \xb7 AsyncTask \xb7 Support Library (v4/v7) \xb7 mpbasebundle\n\nContribution:\nBranded whitelabel instance from the HotelAPP platform \u2014 Parse.com config (HotelAPP/HotelAppGeneric), branded assets via zipCache, and OTA hotel APIs via mpbasebundle."},
