gage(){return"Paulo Emilio Rodrigues de Moraes\nMobile Team Lead \xb7 Engenheiro Mobile S\xeanior\nProbox Studio \xb7 Brasil \xb7 Remoto \xb7 UTC-3"},
gaga(){return"--- PLATAFORMAS & LINGUAGENS ---\n\u2022 Mobile: Android (Kotlin/Java) \xb7 iOS (Swift)\n\u2022 Multiplataforma: Flutter (Dart) \xb7 KMP (Kotlin Multiplatform)\n\u2022 UI Declarativa: Jetpack Compose \xb7 SwiftUI \xb7 Compose Multiplatform (CMP)\n\n--- IDEs AGENTIC & IA ---\n\u2022 IDEs Agentic: Cursor \xb7 Google Antigravity \xb7 OpenAI Codex \xb7 Claude Code (e CLI)\n\u2022 IA & APIs: Agentes de IA \xb7 OpenAPI \xb7 ChatGPT \xb7 Claude (Anthropic) \xb7 Google Gemini \xb7 GitHub Copilot \xb7 MCP \xb7 Integracao com LLMs\n\n--- DOMINIOS & EXPERIENCIA ---\n\u2022 Seguranca Mobile & Banking \xb7 SDK Development \xb7 Android NDK \xb7 OCR \xb7 Liveness \xb7 BLE \xb7 Telemetria \xb7 IoT \xb7 Apps White-label \xb7 Ads em Escala\n\n--- ARQUITETURA & PROCESSO ---\n\u2022 Clean Architecture \xb7 MVVM \xb7 SOLID \xb7 Scrum \xb7 Kanban \xb7 CI/CD \xb7 Git \xb7 GitHub \xb7 GitLab \xb7 Azure DevOps \xb7 Bitbucket \xb7 Autor Tecnico"},
